    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789340/extras/4804c73848536c1fdb73c52e09cda5bd.poster.avif?t=1750096396\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789340/extras/4804c73848536c1fdb73c52e09cda5bd.webm?t=1750096396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789340/extras/4804c73848536c1fdb73c52e09cda5bd.mp4?t=1750096396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Empire Clicker, the addictive idle tycoon game where you click to build and expand your castle, city, and entire kingdom! From humble beginnings to a booming medieval empire, your goal is to gather resources, build structures, and grow your influence across stunning, themed towns.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover new areas!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you rule a snow-covered fortress, a thriving business hub, or a mysterious pirate bay? Every click counts on your journey to become the ultimate king!<br>the game features 11 areas to discover and build your city on<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789340/extras/ba17e67165d4b40582fbe725240ee2a8.avif?t=1750096396\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start tapping and discover what kind of empire you can create\u2014build, conquer, and keep expanding even while you sleep or go AFK!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attack enemy cities!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack enemy cities that spawn on your empire map! Taking down an enemy city rewards you with a legendary cosmetic chest, which can contain rare outfits and exclusive gear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789340/extras/1f34c39769423a740116cd6a23417d51.poster.avif?t=1750096396\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789340/extras/1f34c39769423a740116cd6a23417d51.webm?t=1750096396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789340/extras/1f34c39769423a740116cd6a23417d51.mp4?t=1750096396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your king!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your king with over 38 clothing items and collectibles, boosting your villager generation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789340/extras/f2af4e21d33038e64efe7c8f47b54509.poster.avif?t=1750096396\" width=700 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789340/extras/f2af4e21d33038e64efe7c8f47b54509.webm?t=1750096396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789340/extras/f2af4e21d33038e64efe7c8f47b54509.mp4?t=1750096396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789340/extras/2fecc71f5b03f5c242bc6d8126f927c2.poster.avif?t=1750096396\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789340/extras/2fecc71f5b03f5c242bc6d8126f927c2.webm?t=1750096396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789340/extras/2fecc71f5b03f5c242bc6d8126f927c2.mp4?t=1750096396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 unique city themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless enemy cities to conquer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >38 clothing items to collect for your king</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An infinitely expanding empire map</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789340/extras/4804c73848536c1fdb73c52e09cda5bd.poster.avif?t=1750096396\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789340/extras/4804c73848536c1fdb73c52e09cda5bd.webm?t=1750096396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789340/extras/4804c73848536c1fdb73c52e09cda5bd.mp4?t=1750096396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Empire Clicker, the addictive idle tycoon game where you click to build and expand your castle, city, and entire kingdom! From humble beginnings to a booming medieval empire, your goal is to gather resources, build structures, and grow your influence across stunning, themed towns.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover new areas!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you rule a snow-covered fortress, a thriving business hub, or a mysterious pirate bay? Every click counts on your journey to become the ultimate king!<br>the game features 11 areas to discover and build your city on<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789340/extras/ba17e67165d4b40582fbe725240ee2a8.avif?t=1750096396\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start tapping and discover what kind of empire you can create\u2014build, conquer, and keep expanding even while you sleep or go AFK!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attack enemy cities!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack enemy cities that spawn on your empire map! Taking down an enemy city rewards you with a legendary cosmetic chest, which can contain rare outfits and exclusive gear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789340/extras/1f34c39769423a740116cd6a23417d51.poster.avif?t=1750096396\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789340/extras/1f34c39769423a740116cd6a23417d51.webm?t=1750096396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789340/extras/1f34c39769423a740116cd6a23417d51.mp4?t=1750096396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your king!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your king with over 38 clothing items and collectibles, boosting your villager generation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789340/extras/f2af4e21d33038e64efe7c8f47b54509.poster.avif?t=1750096396\" width=700 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789340/extras/f2af4e21d33038e64efe7c8f47b54509.webm?t=1750096396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789340/extras/f2af4e21d33038e64efe7c8f47b54509.mp4?t=1750096396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789340/extras/2fecc71f5b03f5c242bc6d8126f927c2.poster.avif?t=1750096396\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789340/extras/2fecc71f5b03f5c242bc6d8126f927c2.webm?t=1750096396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789340/extras/2fecc71f5b03f5c242bc6d8126f927c2.mp4?t=1750096396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 unique city themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless enemy cities to conquer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >38 clothing items to collect for your king</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An infinitely expanding empire map</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
